OL,6,FThe rumours started after the 36-year-
OL,7,Fold was a guest of chairman Robbie
OL,8,FCowling for the club's 2-1 victory
OL,9,Fover Fleetwood Town, with the
OL,10,FColchester Gazette reporting that he
OL,11,Fcould be about to launch a sensational
OL,12,Fbid to buy the club.
OL,14,FTonight the club posted a statement on
OL,15,Fthe social media platform X.
OL,17,FColchester United chairman Robbie
OL,18,FCowling has been actively looking to
OL,19,Fsell the club for a while but it is,
OL,20,Fas yet, unclear why the deal fell
OL,21,Fthrough.
